Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.65,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(382,77)}Doraemon's Great Prophecy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.65,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs29\)\pos(280,563)}Brought to you by: Ko-Fi.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.69,0:00:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.25,0:00:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Magic Hand of 22nd century.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Doraemon, don't fool around{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to stop you from going out no matter how.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.26,0:00:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You are going to see Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.09,0:00:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She is bored at home alone so she wants you to go to her house to play with her
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you sure are informed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.64,0:00:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.73,0:00:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop me! It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, I will let you see what happens if you go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.65,0:00:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,See, your future is printed in this photo album.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You got hit on your way to her house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.37,0:01:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It took you 1 month to recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.12,0:01:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not so smart at the first place and it's getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.12,0:01:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.96,0:01:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So you'd better stay home all-day today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.46,0:01:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} will be angry
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.59,0:01:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} has called you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.80,0:01:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me reject her call for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.90,0:01:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.94,0:01:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.73,0:01:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you please let me speak too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.78,0:01:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Funny Manga and specially-made cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.78,0:01:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you reject her call for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.29,0:01:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, I told her you are on your way to her house.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.33,0:01:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it OK for you if I get hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry since I will come with you, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.84,0:01:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Cake and Manga awaits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.55,0:01:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.13,0:01:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing, lets go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.18,0:02:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Time TV!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We will be there in 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.03,0:02:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, that's the place where you get hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.37,0:02:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That way was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.70,0:02:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,it's OK since we know it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.17,0:02:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you step on my son's toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.38,0:02:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of accident too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.68,0:02:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The danger still lurks us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.01,0:02:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead when you walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,it might come from behind, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.64,0:02:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to watch ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.19,0:02:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind! Ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.06,0:02:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, ahead, behind, next
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.15,0:02:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see all of them at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.83,0:03:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So many cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.13,0:03:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.96,0:03:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, we must walk through the buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.92,0:03:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to come to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.43,0:03:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a street over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.60,0:03:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.31,0:03:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is a car!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.61,0:03:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.87,0:03:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You entered my private yard! Are you two, thieves?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.41,0:03:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there is a profound reason behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Just to avoid a car, you came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.63,0:04:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This house is just right on the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.17,0:04:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So trucks crash in all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.22,0:04:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,See.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.31,0:04:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it, there is a route that is definitely safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.64,0:04:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, why didn't you think of it, earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.19,0:04:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I could ask you the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't put up with this, I wanna go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late, you will get hit on our way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.26,0:04:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.35,0:04:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! I wonder why didn't I think of it earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, it's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.23,0:05:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Bamboo 'Copter!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.82,0:05:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Put this on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.37,0:05:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you took it out earlier? It's very handy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.50,0:05:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I see Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}'s house
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}, good afternoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.73,0:05:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.35,0:05:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I was so bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So I asked my neighbor's kids to come over to my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.82,0:05:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you glad, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.07,0:05:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.95,0:05:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But compared to this photo...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing really serious, so it's ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.45,0:05:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.63,0:06:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you are right!
